A_035 - If you wake up in the morning with a terrible headache due to high blood pressure, I recommend raising the head of your bed by placing raised pieces under the legs at the head end, and if that doesn't work, using two pillows. If this doesn't work and you still have high blood pressure, I recommend trying drinking chokeberry juice (but not on an empty stomach, and dilute it with water). It was a lifesaver for me; eating too much salt had damaged my arteries and caused high blood pressure.